ENGLISH
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This repository is not open source. It is public for portfolio purposes:
the source code is published to be read and evaluated. No licence is
granted, expressly or by implication.

PERMITTED

  1. Reading and studying the code on GitHub, and quoting it briefly with
     attribution.
  2. Opening the published demonstration (GitHub Pages) or the built file
     (dist/worldline.html) in a web browser for personal evaluation.

NOT PERMITTED WITHOUT PRIOR WRITTEN PERMISSION

  3. Copying, reproducing or modifying the code in whole or in part, beyond
     what GitHub's Terms of Service require for public repositories
     (viewing, forking).
  4. Redistributing the code or the built file, modified or not.
  5. Hosting, publishing or operating it as a service or product, under
     this name or any other, whether commercial or not.
  6. Reusing the code, data or algorithms, including to train or evaluate
     machine-learning models.
  7. Removing or altering this copyright notice.

NO WARRANTY

The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. In no
event shall the author be liable for any damages arising from the
software or its use.

